      "writtenOn": "2018-01-08T15:42:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it\u0027s good that you unittest this, but I\u0027d also like to see a complete test. \n\nCan you cook up a net.Conn that adds a rogue line before the version string, and verify that one can create a ssh connection like that? That test should fail without your changes.\n\nAlso, this would be a good time to double check that we forbid having \\n and \\r in theversion string that we send ourselves.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "f053dc1610446ea5a853a7fc1758a52541be6ae3",
