        "id": 26164
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-08T16:56:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SGTM. I had that first but ended up removing it (not sure if it was overkill or not).\n\nI originally modified ssh/client_test.go\u0027s version test with a test table (since it had net.Conn instrumented already). It was failing the test before my changes. Would you like me to continue down that path or do you want an additional one in ssh/transport_test.go?",
      "parentUuid": "ff5db70e_f0e49e03",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "f053dc1610446ea5a853a7fc1758a52541be6ae3",
